  <content>
  <section><para>Complete the following questions to practice the skills you have learned in this lesson.</para>
<div class="os-raise-ib-pset" data-button-text="Check" data-content-id="41495d20-c4fa-4f99-b895-52a4494b8104" data-fire-learning-opportunity-event="eventnameY" data-fire-success-event="eventnameX" data-retry-limit="2" data-schema-version="1.0"> <!--Q#1-->
  <exercise data-content-id="73e4ba8b-5ba4-41b1-8314-aae3db1bcec7" data-problem-type="multiplechoice" data-retry-limit="3" data-solution="\((-4, 6)\)" data-solution-options="[&quot;\\((8, 22)\\)&quot;, &quot;\\((0, 22)\\)&quot;, &quot;\\((-4, 6)\\)&quot;, &quot;\\((4, 6)\\)&quot;]">
    <problem>
      <para>Which of the following points is the vertex of the quadratic function \(f(x)=x^2+8x+22\)?</para>
      </problem>
    <solution>
      <para>Correct! \((-4, 6)\)</para>
      <para>\((\frac{b}{2})^2=(\frac{8}{2})^2=16\)</para>
    </solution>
    <div class="os-raise-ib-pset-encourage-response">
      <para>Try again. Revisit activity 9.9.1.</para>
    </div>
    </exercise>
  <!--END QUESTION.--> <!--Do not edit below line.-->
  <solution>
    <!-- INSERT ANY VALID HTML HERE -->
  </solution>
  <div class="os-raise-ib-pset-encourage-response">
